l="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 320 512" class="w-3 h-3" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M285.476 272.971L91.132 467.314c-9.373 9.373-24.569 9.373-33.941 0l-22.667-22.667c-9.357-9.357-9.375-24.522-.04-33.901L188.505 256 34.484 101.255c-9.335-9.379-9.317-24.544.04-33.901l22.667-22.667c9.373-9.373 24.569-9.373 33.941 0L285.475 239.03c9.373 9.372 9.373 24.568.001 33.941z"></path></svg><span class="text-white/40">Membership</span></nav><div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-3 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-white border border-gray-200 mb-8 backdrop-blur-sm shadow-sm"><span class="text-gray-900 text-xl"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-gray-900 font-semibold">Membership</span></div><h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-light mb-6 text-gray-900 leading-tight tracking-tight">Exchange Membership</h1><p class="text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-600 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed font-light">Membership requirements and options for joining MERJ Exchange as a qualified financial services provider.</p></div></section></div><main class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 pb-12 "><div class="space-y-24"><div class="transition-all ease-out " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px);transition-duration:500ms;transition-timing-function:cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)"><div class="relative bg-white backdrop-blur-xl rounded-3xl p-10 border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-500" style="box-shadow:0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8)"><div class="text-center mb-12"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Membership Requirements</h2><h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-gradient-animated mb-6 tracking-tight">Join the Global Exchange</h3></div><div class="space-y-12"><div><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 font-light mb-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto leading-relaxed text-center">Full Member status of MERJ Exchange is available for applicants that meet one of the following minimum requirements:</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="group p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mt-1 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check h-4 w-4 text-gray-900" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-black transition-colors">Licensed Seychelles Securities Dealer</h4><p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed">Direct access to full membership for Seychelles-licensed entities</p></div></div></div><div class="group p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mt-1 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe h-4 w-4 text-gray-900" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-black transition-colors">Recognized Jurisdiction Member</h4><p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed">Licensed securities broker/dealer and Member of a securities exchange in recognized jurisdictions including Austria, Australia, Belgium, Bahamas, Bahrain, Bermuda, British Virgin Islands, Canada, Cayman Islands, Cyprus, Denmark, France, Germany, Gibraltar, Guernsey, Hong Kong, Isle of Man, Ireland, Japan, Jersey, Luxembourg, Malaysia (including Labuan), Mauritius, Netherlands, New Zealand, Singapore, South Africa, Switzerland, United Arab Emirates, United Kingdom, United States of America</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pt-8 border-t border-gray-200"><p class="text-lg text-gray-600 font-light mb-8 text-center">For licensed Broker-Dealers that do not meet one of the above minimum requirements or those that may be restricted by regulations in their home jurisdiction there are two additional options:</p><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8"><div class="group p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mt-1 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-users h-4 w-4 text-gray-900" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><path d="M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744"></path><path d="M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-black transition-colors">Introducing Broker</h4><p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed">Alternative membership option for qualified institutions</p></div></div></div><div class="group p-8 bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-300 transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-105"><div class="flex items-start gap-4"><div class="w-6 h-6 rounded-full bg-gray-300 mt-1 flex-shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield h-4 w-4 text-gray-900" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path></svg></div><div><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-gray-900 mb-3 group-hover:text-black transition-colors">Sponsored Access</h4><p class="text-gray-600 font-light leading-relaxed">Access through an existing Member with sponsorship arrangement</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="transition-all ease-out " style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(25px);transition-duration:500ms;transition-timing-function:cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1)"><div class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-50 to-white rounded-3xl p-10 border border-gray-200" style="box-shadow:0 25px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8)"><div class="text-center"><h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-6 tracking-tight">Ready to Apply for Membership?</h2><h3 class="text-2xl font-light text-gradient-animated mb-8 tracking-tight">Start Your Application Journey</h3><p class="text-xl text-gray-600 font-light mb-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Get in touch with us today to learn more about membership opportunities and how to begin the application process.</p><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center"><a class="btn-primary" href="/contact"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 